  "description": "The device's own camera for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, driven from a page anywhere — a live MJPEG viewfinder, the shutter, video recording, lens, zoom, torch and effects, with captures filed into a file root. A camera screen the bridge shows on request, or one of your own with CameraBridgeView. One call: bridge.AddCameraBridge().",
